Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:20:20 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: animate block form sections when switching type or
 toggling logging

- type sections, log options and the Skip TLS verify rows use Bootstrap's
  collapse instead of the hidden attribute, via a shared setSectionShown()
- sections on inactive tabs switch instantly; hidden fieldsets are disabled
  once closed; toggles made mid-animation settle on the latest state
- toggle_card gains a `reveals` argument (data-reveals) so any switch can
  open a section, ready for HTTP basic auth and access list
- row-cards gap moved inside animated sections (mt-0 + pt-2 pt-lg-3)
  so it animates instead of snapping

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
